{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:03:58.911Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fec30a92d8d98f6016acafc7a7bb481919b33d145c7b5f8f8","status":"completed","call_id":"call_d44bce7f7ded4695957de4a2355fc828","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > output/live-council-verification/RESUME.md <<'EOF'\\n# Paused at user request — 2026-10-11\\n\\nBoth live councils are PAUSED. Do not resume until the user asks. Verification helper processes were stopped; there is no automatic resume. Backend and frontend remain available. Changes are uncommitted on main; preserve unrelated UI work.\\n\\n## Saved live results\\n- Full native vehicle council: session-d89c6fa5806243db (G60 / Europe / Electric), started 02:42:39 UTC. 20 topics. Paused at Display / validation, after 3 closed topics.\\n- Range: real native specialists and Judge completed in 398.799 active seconds. Competitor abstained due missing own-domain range evidence.\\n- Charging: ALL three native specialist implementations contributed real outputs; cross-agent challenges/rebuttals and original Judge service completed in 533.486 active seconds (8m53s). Judge assessment 9a6613e3-0a4f-4d76-95c3-b1d8ba06cff3, execution live, provider qwen, model qwen3:8b. Real app/route-planning proposal, deferred pending evidence. Original implementation names/native outputs remain in export.\\n- Controls in original run failed on pause/resume reservation accounting (no Judge assessment). NOT a passing result.\\n- Fresh linked Controls regression: session-46f57ecc65f04532, parent original. Started 03:02:39 UTC; now paused at perspectives, zero outcomes. Resume and complete this before declaring repair verified end to end.\\n- Latest immutable pause exports: paused-session-*.json and paused-checkpoint.json. Older latest-export.json/watch progress do not include final pause unless copied; use paused exports.\\n\\n## Voice gap repaired and REAL browser test passed\\n- Current vehicle council voice popup now uses actual ElevenLabs STT -> local Qwen saved Judge discussion -> actual ElevenLabs TTS. Preserves original shared UI/orb. It no longer depends on the teammate hosted ElevenLabs agent's brain for this route.\\n- Real recorded question supplied as browser mic audio (Chrome test media input); no API/provider mocks. STT 200, Qwen 200, TTS 200, actual browser audio playback state observed, no browser JS errors. Reply 812d99b7-e848-4b48-918c-ed0cd81b29bd, qwen3:8b, 3104 input / 205 output tokens. Actual audio response took about 48s from popup start while council was running.\\n- Evidence: voice-browser-result.json, voice-qwen-speaking.png, pm-review-result.json, pm-requirement-review.png. First voice script recorded zero cards due immediate navigation; separate real PM review test PASSED with one actual requirement and explicit pending review. No PM decisions were submitted.\\n- Different conversation IDs filter backend history; fresh-thread isolation still needs additional end-to-end verification. Latest audio timer cleanup patch is NOT yet rebuilt/retested.\\n- Legacy/proposal voice paths still use hosted ElevenLabs; live VehicleCouncil route uses local Qwen. Do not claim all legacy voice paths changed.\\n\\n## Code changes this verification task\\n- New src/components/council/useLocalJudgeConversation.ts: real microphone VAD/STT, local Qwen ask transport, saved-reply TTS, audio-level orb animation, end-session cleanup.\\n- JudgeConversationSession.tsx and JuryConversation.tsx integrate local transport and Review/confirm link.\\n- backend/moderator/discussion.py: fresh thread IDs, actual Qwen model/token provenance, local_qwen_speech config. Last reload added technical citation IDs only in JSON field, not spoken prose; client transcripts marked client_conversation_transcript rather than falsely calling all ElevenLabs transcripts.\\n- Queued inference cancellation budget fix in backend/llm/usage.py, ollama.py, judge/providers.py, moderator/native.py and engine.py. Refund only calls canceled before actual request dispatch; retain conservative charge for started requests. Retry slot also refunded. check-reservations.py passed 3 actual Engine/OllamaAdapter lock-queue cancellation cycles without mocks; no model output is claimed by that check.\\n- engine.py now marks outcome assessment_valid false if no assessment exists (old stored outcomes are preserved).\\n- Market challenge validator rejects exact copies of agenda question; prompt requests concrete peer challenge. Competitor challenge prompt no longer provides a generic template that Qwen copied verbatim. These last quality changes are loaded but awaiting real regression completion.\\n- Live backend restarted with changes, exec session 43818, log /tmp/bmw-integrated-backend-verified.log. Old backend stopped safely after pausing at single-call validation checkpoint. All agents configured qwen3:8b; actual Ollama /api/ps confirmed.\\n\\n## Resume actions\\n1. Read this file and paused exports. Resume only on user instruction. Do not restart a new full run unnecessarily.\\n2. Resume linked Controls via POST /api/moderator/sessions/{id}/controls with action resume, current expected_revision and fresh UUID idempotency_key. Monitor export; finish real Judge assessment, check token accounting/errors and targeted challenge quality.\\n3. Resume original Display validation and remaining full vehicle topics; record actual wall/active time, excluding or clearly labeling user pause. The full 20-topic agenda is slow (many minutes per topic), not a few-minute total.\\n4. Further live voice fresh-thread, stale-assessment and playback cleanup checks; no mocks and no PM approvals without user decision. Build frontend after latest cleanup; Python compileall passed before last frontend cleanup.\\n5. Provide an honest final verification report; do not claim whole 20-topic run finished or all topics passed. Current checks establish real model execution and complete debate cycle on Range/Charging plus voice and review handoff.\\n6. Advanced Moderator/agenda redesign is explicitly deferred. User wants original Moderator branch-style UI later.\\n\\nNo keys/secrets in these artifacts. Do not output .env content.\\nEOF\",\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a128d6-e4d1-7942-a322-f4130d38a345","create_time":1791687802.487559}}}
