{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:00:46.037Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fec30a92d8d98f6016acb09e965cc8191a6231885873cce28","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ec3b7f9a6c0e495e908d97f532ec89be","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat >> src/styles/vehicle-council.css <<'EOF'\\n.jury-compact-launch .jury-avatar {width:190px;height:190px;}\\n.jury-compact-launch .jury-avatar-stage > strong,\\n.jury-compact-launch .jury-avatar-stage > span,\\n.jury-voice-popup .jury-avatar-stage > strong,\\n.jury-voice-popup .jury-avatar-stage > span {display:none;}\\n@media(max-width:600px){.jury-compact-launch .jury-avatar{width:155px;height:155px;}}\\nEOF\\npython3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json\\ns=json.load(open('output/council-rework/latest-export.json'))['session']\\nfor p in (s.get('work') or {}).get('positions',[]): print(p['actor'],p.get('implementation'),p['summary'][:1100])\\nprint('errors',(s.get('work') or {}).get('errors'))\\nPY\\ngit check-ignore private-data/inputs/G60_feedback_hackathon.xlsx\",\"max_output_tokens\":1600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","create_time":1791691241.401656}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:00:46.158Z","type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1261a-2a92-7960-ad84-d63846639755","turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","session_id":"01a1261a-2a92-7960-ad84-d63846639755","root_turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","response_id":"resp_0fec30a92d8d98f6016acb09e1156c819197da78ace6fbd83b","usage":{"input_tokens":174591,"cached_input_tokens":173056,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":407,"reasoning_output_tokens":157,"total_tokens":174998},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":4326758,"cached_input_tokens":4252800,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":17144,"reasoning_output_tokens":4975,"total_tokens":4343902},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":178703296,"cached_input_tokens":174023552,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":822945,"reasoning_output_tokens":213331,"total_tokens":179526241}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:00:46.180Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1291e-ca64-7263-b720-fcab02e28b9f","call_id":"call_ec3b7f9a6c0e495e908d97f532ec89be","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"c5e848\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000011958,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":546,\"output\":\"customer backend.customer_agent.agent.CustomerAgent.perspective The G60's driving experience is praised for its comfort and ride quality, but there are concerns about handling responsiveness and braking performance compared to peers. The infotainment system is highly rated for its features but faces criticism regarding usability and integration with external services. Customers praise the ride quality (STUDY:CN_EU_2025:52:G60) and comfort, but also note handling issues and braking performance concerns (G60-3567). The infotainment system is highly rated for features, but usability and integration are criticized. Retain the high-quality ride and comfort, while addressing usability issues in the infotainment system and improving connectivity features such as Android Auto and charging status visibility. The feedback and study results reflect a limited sample of European G60 owners, which may not represent the full customer base.\\nmarket backend.agents.market.MarketParticipant.turn The current BMW iDrive system, with its panoramic display and haptic steering-wheel controls, is a documented direction but not yet confirmed for the G60. Euro NCAP’s 2026 programme highlights the importance of essential-control placement and usability, which suggests a potential shift toward more intuitive and accessible control layouts. However, there is no evidence that this direction has been implemented in the G60. A proposed test could involve integrating a rear-mounted control panel with physical buttons for essential functions, which would allow drivers to access critical controls without diverting attention from the road. This would trade off the aesthetic and space efficiency of a minimalist design for enhanced usability and safety. The validation step would be to conduct a user study with a sample of G60 drivers to assess the impact on driving safety and user satisfaction.\\ncompetitor backend.council.participants.GroundedParticipant.turn[competitor] The proposed feature requires a conditional experiment to assess usability, not a feature comparison. BMW's equipment availability is unknown, and no verified competitor feature comparisons are supplied.\\nerrors []\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","create_time":1791691246.18067}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
