t?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a126a0-c058-7762-aa0b-cc9e2639c27f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791649431.64059,"turn_id":"01a126a0-bfae-75c2-a0b8-bf14a96af990"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"then download get Ollama \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a126a2-5934-79e3-b8eb-08dcc9f855f6","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791649536.308965,"turn_id":"01a126a0-bfae-75c2-a0b8-bf14a96af990"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"pause now am on 15\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a126be-2bdd-7680-ba8a-21c4ba7ed91d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791651359.709935,"turn_id":"01a126a0-bfae-75c2-a0b8-bf14a96af990"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"ok so can u continue now but also can u make sure u got very good accurate up to date competitor data and also how do I know where Ollama is running and how and if I even have it now and stuff?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1270f-82fa-7913-b648-b70905b5e3a5","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791656690.426395,"turn_id":"01a1270f-824a-7c21-b449-d05ffc3c1766"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"can we also make our page part look super cool with real official competitor logos and stuff super fancy styles \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12728-429c-71b2-af19-e46cde26c27a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791658312.348167,"turn_id":"01a12728-41e1-79d0-aad5-b8374b61fffe"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"and the agent fully works right? for sure? and the data u r showing and the workflow is working? for sure? \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1273d-23fe-7311-befc-1965349f0504","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791659680.766407,"turn_id":"01a1273d-2338-78b2-adeb-dc8d6ca6e7b0"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"make it fully connected also please can u try including more competitors like Audi, Volkswagen, more Chinese big brands etc. perhaps? and furthermore here on the UI of the page of that part\n\nmake it more simpler like I can select a brand and very clearly see from a model from their brand what it has that CLEARLY BMW does not have and show next to it a percent of success it generates currently for its brand and what it could benefit for us or smth like that like really simple showing but super super clear not too many random stuff yeah? also ofc use the real logos and stuff and also have u made sure it is connected also the agent to the agent debate section properly has it? and which Qwen model is it running on btw?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12749-631e-7291-88a2-339aa053285a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791660483.358738,"turn_id":"01a12749-626f-75c3-8306-cbcb41658861"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_xCmmIIoXwWOEiZlgH2aQQXuJ\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"Are your teammates’ Customer and Market agents already available in this checkout, or only on their own branches? I can connect the Competitor agent to a working local Qwen council now and leave clear integration points for their implementations.\",\"answer\":\"Not built yet\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1274f-37c2-7863-bf8f-36413529176e","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791660865.47437,"turn_id":"01a12749-626f-75c3-8306-cbcb41658861"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"what link do I use to access it bcs on my Microsoft Edge I am not seeing the same outputs as if I click here \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12780-2e48-74f1-8336-b4a5bd370e5a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791664074.31276,"turn_id":"01a12780-2d0f-7880-bc39-7153be9df963"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"not working anyways it is here like in VS Code if I open ur link it works and shows updates but on Microsoft Edge\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12781-b090-75c3-a612-f3bd79a50f2f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791664173.200179,"turn_id":"01a12781-afd2-7323-9169-2ee426224878"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"ok so this agent is properly done correct?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1278b-6c65-7612-89ff-d0469e6c1fdc","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791664811.109243,"turn_id":"01a1278b-6bcc-7590-b357-eef70d7eecda"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"ok now switch to the market trend branch and make a planned workflow \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12799-fdf2-7b23-b153-f00a7666c111","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791665765.874162,"turn_id":"01a12799-fce4-7211-a141-ff150a94bb6f"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"check the dataset to see if there is enough data for market trends or not from here\n/Users/shaur/TUM/BMWHack\n\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1279b-f857-7b51-b5e6-37a4efec79c5","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791665895.511609,"turn_id":"01a1279b-f76d-77a0-85ba-74ce3a8a1377"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"alright so now make the Market Trend agent but also btw does market trends also include what is hot in the Auto Car industry rn or...? just asking? \n\nalso make the Market Trend Agent now and also ofc update its site properly cleanly not oveflow of random info clean organised please and visually stunning okay make big UI changes if u must but make it look incredible and animative and stuff really cool effects also make it work in the Agent Debate site of course too and accurately arguing capabilities in the debate\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1279f-cff2-7f70-8e2b-095531526569","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791666147.31483,"turn_id":"01a1279f-cf1a-70d0-a91c-a3bb4e4afb6d"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"btw it looks wayyy too weirded out and simlpe and vibe coded AI slop the Market page btw u need to revolutionalize it and stop adding too many unecessary sections and make it clear on one subsite the Market one okay? please do so make it clear make it more chique fancy miniamlistic somehow but with super cool laser elements and glows or something no green pls only BMW styles and stuff\n\nbut does the agent work properly everywhere it needs to?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a127b8-f79d-7993-bdf1-46e6f7b06f35","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791667795.869603,"turn_id":"01a127b8-eff3-7183-8964-2e96c1b03245"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"r u sure these are REAL verified market trends? from the dataset and maybe from more sources online u can add more and scrape and improve the agent bcs isn't market trends also for trending features and stuff make it more rich and accurate and cooler more organised somehow also the UI and sections please\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a127c2-d29e-71b1-abe3-a48981ec3041","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791668441.758244,"turn_id":"01a127c2-d1d4-7182-8c0f-cbae0861b42b"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"what is this is the agent not working or what is going on? quickly fix it make it work quickly ja \n","type":"input_text"},{"detail":"high","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","type":"input_image"}],"id":"msg_01a127d4-f9a0-7243-9d95-1ce051719284","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text","user.image"],"create_time":1791669631.392927,"turn_id":"01a127d4-f8db-7393-9de4-bf30a441b03b"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Okay, so now basically we have created all the agents on our respective branches. Now what I want you to do is to go to these branches, check out all the code, and your task is to essentially now merge all of these agents and branches into the main without disrupting any functionality, making it all work cleanly together, and all the respective sites that the branches have created for their agent should all be working nicely as intended and as created in the agent debate. A clean debate should be able to be run. The judge agent should work. The moderator agent should work. The customer feedback agent should work. The market research trends agent should work. All agents basically. I don't know if I've missed one, but all of them should work. Competitor agent, yeah, that was the one I missed. But anyway, all of these should be able to run, and the judge agent, the voice from 11 Labs, that part should also be able to work at the end of the debate. It should be able to work seamlessly and perfectly. Merge basically all branches except the branch that has the presentation generation part based on the final requirements that have been accepted by the project manager. That branch is still being worked on, so do not merge that presentation generation branch onto the main, and make sure that all the other agents are being hosted by Quen from Olama on my laptop here, and yes, make it go to merge, I believe, for the 11 Labs part, the voice agent for the jury to work. You will need an API key potentially. That part you can ask me later about, or you can go and create—I give you access to go and create one from 11 Labs and use it if you don't have it, or if the other person from my project has not implemented that part, that can be shared. Do that, make it work. Thank you.\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a127e6-5544-7f31-821d-453c431f8854","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791670768.964085,"turn_id":"01a127e6-548f-7ba2-b6be-265619d8dd94"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_7866a7c7b9274f6796fe830c738af221\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"Automatic approval review blocked the audio test because it sends a project-derived verdict to ElevenLabs. May I send the saved Judge narration to ElevenLabs for speech synthesis? The exact prepared sample is in [judge-narration-preview.md](/Users/shaur/ehlhackathonbmw/output/judge-narration-preview.md); only narration text is sent, using the restricted key I created.\",\"answer\":\"Yes, test Judge narration with ElevenLabs\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a127f8-28ff-7ec1-89c5-d4f4a9198611","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791671937.279281,"turn_id":"01a127e6-548f-7ba2-b6be-265619d8dd94"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"give me a status report now please how far are u bcs in the debate I only see kind of the moderator selection view and not like the live debate option and stuff so yeah? also how long must we wait for one full debate to run? how far are u with the merging and also can u make the 3D agents on the UI something else something more cooler and meaningful to what they do like the agent some 3D moving emoji in BMW style like customer could be an interesting customer 3D icon or smth u get it yeah \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a1282e-8961-7001-aeba-b2a8f39c3480","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791675500.897129,"turn_id":"01a127e6-548f-7ba2-b6be-265619d8dd94"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"wait wait we need to seriously take a step back and understand what we want basically this page the agent council to accurately making the agents debate as the demo had showed u know and the voice jury agent should accurately show like just make it all clean and work quickly properly now yeah it has become very convoluted and weird and full of text not clear enough and moved things all over the place the workflow should be simple as the demo as in the PM can start a debate also btw the debate should just be on the car model we describe and should entail all the topics covered by the moderator yeah not just for example as before we could click on just batteries no it should be overall features all kinds for the car we delve into understand? and make the UI much better for the agent part as well the 3D symbols are not big enough there should be more cooler animations for the agents something interactive something cool maybe add a fancy table at the top where the agents are 3D moving and sitting and when one is talking a holo glows around them and they are junping or smth and make the debate smoothly work right now it is uncelar transcripts are not showing properly its quite a mess and the jury needs to output to the site decisions \u0026 scenarios of course yeah keep that in mind pls just inspect everything and make it work smoothly but btw is everything merged into the main right now?? the voice agent is just giving a voice recording no interactive talking to ElevenLabs through the Jury Qwen agent no interactive discussion with the frontend part created in the elevanlabs voice jury part I do not see the voice icon moving or anything that was in that branch earlier I am unable to have any discussion or anything this is quite poor quality merging I must be honest \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12842-5b87-7893-9a0c-98c862db27ec","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791676799.879905,"turn_id":"01a12842-592c-7a72-80d1-1b494a20cbff"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_14cd2a4360814677a0def018b8f2d199\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"The interactive Jury is built, but ElevenLabs rejected transcription because the existing key has only Text to Speech access. May I enable only Speech to Text on that key, keeping its 10,000-credit limit and other restrictions? The browser security rule requires confirmation before expanding API-key permissions.\",\"answer\":\"Yes, enable Speech to Text\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a12851-1941-7bc3-bc2b-d1caaa2cec7d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791677765.953664,"turn_id":"01a12842-592c-7a72-80d1-1b494a20cbff"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"wait first find the voice thing make it work again properly from the voice agent branch we may have to manually make u implement feature by feature copy the exact voice agent part with ElevenLabs and connect it with the jury and make it work remember this?????? like please just go to every branch again and do a MANUAL merge if u must okay? like manually look at each branch all the unique features and like remake this agent debate page with all of it working smoothly together if u must okay? just make it workkkkk and use the real implementations from the branches it is very important that each agent is accurately used from each branch what each teammate did okay u cannot unecessarily make fake agents please use the hardwork of the teammates and 