{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:40:45.036Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a12943-64ec-78f0-8281-cdcf3420eb1e","call_id":"call_a0a01726c6f744f2aa9d63edf9000352","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"6359b1\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006625,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":366,\"output\":\"rebuttals []\\n[('customer', 'Why focus on competitors when the G60’s own users are struggling with basic language support and ConnectedDrive integration?', None), ('market', 'What specific usability test would validate the effectiveness of integrating both haptic steering-wheel controls and a rear-mounted control panel in the G60 for essential functions during driving?', None), ('competitor', 'What specific usability test would validate the effectiveness of integrating both haptic steering-wheel controls and a rear-mounted control panel in the G60 for essential functions during driving?', \\\"BMW's Panoramic iDrive concept, projected across the lower windscreen, offers a novel way to keep essential controls accessible during driving. However, it relies on haptic steering-wheel controls, which may not be universally accessible or intuitive for all drivers. Euro NCAP’s 2026 programme emphasizes the importance of essential-control placement, clarity, and usability, suggesting that physical controls may still be necessary for certain drivers. A proposed test could involve integrating a combination of haptic steering-wheel controls and a rear-mounted control panel, with a validation step assessing usability and driver satisfaction through a controlled study. This approach balances innovation with accessibility, addressing both the need for intuitive controls and the potential limitations of screen-based interfaces.\\\")]\\nactive 227.50307995802723\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","create_time":1791693645.036837}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
