{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:44:22.082Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a12946-b4c2-7511-a808-024c38d7a8cf","call_id":"call_0376b6acf2f14b08b4f9888749d2e7ed","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"666a25\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006916,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":360,\"output\":\"perspectives []\\n[('customer', 'The feedback highlights a mixed perception of infotainment and connectivity in the G60, with praise for the information and entertainment system but complaints about ConnectedDrive services and voice control limitations. Customers praise the information and entertainment system (STUDY:CN_EU_2025:30:G60), but also complain about ConnectedDrive services and lack of Danish voice control (G60-2254). Retain the strong performance in the information and entertainment system as it is praised by customers, while addressing the issues with ConnectedDrive and language support. The feedback is self-selected, so the findings may not represent all customers.'), ('market', \\\"BMW's Panoramic iDrive concept, projected across the lower windscreen, and haptic steering-wheel controls, aligns with the need for essential controls to remain accessible during driving. However, the Euro NCAP 2026 programme emphasizes the importance of physical controls for usability and clarity, suggesting that a hybrid approach—combining haptic steering-wheel controls with a lower windscreen display—may offer the best balance. This approach ensures that drivers can access critical functions without diverting their attention from the road, while also meeting safety and usability standards. A concrete validation step would be to conduct a usability test with real drivers to assess the effectiveness of this hybrid system.\\\")]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","create_time":1791693862.082246}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
