{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T04:50:17.644Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1294c-21ac-7f40-b38d-d5b92d7627c2","call_id":"call_fc10f37ff76f426d904f7201f93f4ca0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"defdbe\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007125,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":860,\"output\":\"backend/presentation/api.py:169:@router.post(\\\"/{pid}/revision-proposals\\\")\\nbackend/presentation/api.py:181:@router.post(\\\"/{pid}/revision-proposals/{cid}/{action}\\\")\\nbackend/presentation/models.py:345:    proposals: list[RevisionProposal] = Field(default_factory=list)\\nbackend/presentation/service.py:695:            p.proposals.append(\\nbackend/presentation/service.py:841:        proposal = next((c for c in p.proposals if c.id == change_id), None)\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:38:- Council outcomes and individual requirement proposals have separate reviews. Use the PM controls on each judge proposal. Approving an outcome alone selects no requirements.\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:74:The layout library covers cover, customer problem, evidence, portfolio, customer journey, alternatives matrix, capital allocation, financial scenarios, department responsibilities, pilot roadmap, risks and decision, plus the evidence appendix. New slides expose structured editors for the fields appropriate to their layout. Source quotations remain protected; interpretations, responsibilities, milestones and caveats can be edited. Qwen uses bounded layout-specific schemas, and cannot assign owners/dates, replace source identities or write numerical chart data. Unknowns remain unknown. Text and voice revisions still create proposals for Apply/Discard.\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:122:6. Check tool calls in the ElevenLabs conversation transcript if navigation or proposals fail. Names and parameter identifiers are case-sensitive; enable **Wait for response**. A connected agent that only talks without changing the UI may be missing its tools.\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:140:| `POST /{id}/revision-proposals`                                    | Request a proposed targeted change.                                                                      |\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:141:| `POST /{id}/revision-proposals/{change}/apply` or `/discard`       | Explicit PM disposition.                                                                                 |\\nbackend/presentation/README.md:148:Mutating deck operations require `expected_revision`; stale edits return HTTP 409. Generation uses an idempotency key; replays return the existing job and conflicting reuse is rejected. The moderator proposal-review endpoint is `POST /api/moderator/sessions/{session}/outcomes/{topic}/proposals/{proposal}/review`, with `expected_version`, `expected_outcome_version`, `status` and PM `rationale`.\\nbackend/presentation/sources.py:94:        for proposal in outcome.assessment.proposals:\\n{\\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-10-11T04:48:21.610591+00:00\\\", \\\"sequence\\\": 16, \\\"status\\\": \\\"running\\\", \\\"topic\\\": \\\"topic-controls\\\", \\\"stage\\\": \\\"synthesis\\\", \\\"outcomes\\\": 0, \\\"active_seconds\\\": 285.8774732502643, \\\"tokens\\\": 108901}\\n{\\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-10-11T04:49:11.660024+00:00\\\", \\\"sequence\\\": 17, \\\"status\\\": \\\"running\\\", \\\"topic\\\": \\\"topic-controls\\\", \\\"stage\\\": \\\"challenges\\\", \\\"outcomes\\\": 0, \\\"active_seconds\\\": 340.65090062539093, \\\"tokens\\\": 122103}\\n{\\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-10-11T04:49:31.698230+00:00\\\", \\\"sequence\\\": 18, \\\"status\\\": \\\"running\\\", \\\"topic\\\": \\\"topic-controls\\\", \\\"stage\\\": \\\"challenges\\\", \\\"outcomes\\\": 0, \\\"active_seconds\\\": 340.65090062539093, \\\"tokens\\\": 124039}\\n{\\n  \\\"passed\\\": true,\\n  \\\"accepted_and_rejected_real_requirement\\\": true,\\n  \\\"stale_version_rejected\\\": true,\\n  \\\"real_model_outcome_reused\\\": true,\\n  \\\"temporary_database_only\\\": true,\\n  \\\"production_pm_decisions_changed\\\": false,\\n  \\\"provider_mocks\\\": false\\n}\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a12915-f14a-7292-888b-5b2b4a685e60","create_time":1791694217.644286}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
