igation or display. Also enriches model-generated song lists by batch-matching them to Apple Music tracks, a...","mcp__codex_apps__canva":"Create, review, edit designs","mcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space":"Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.","mcp__codex_apps__codex_document_control":"Use Codex Document Control to find connected document sessions, inspect the tools supported by a selected session, and execute one supported tool against that session. Call `list_document_sessions` first to choose the intended connected session, c...","mcp__codex_apps__codex_security_cloud":"Run security scans, investigate findings, and manage workflows for the current workspace.","mcp__codex_apps__figma":"Create designs, ship to code","mcp__codex_apps__github":"Access repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex","mcp__codex_apps__gmail":"Gmail tools for label counts, searching and reading emails/threads/attachments, reviewing drafts, and explicit mail changes like send, draft, forward, archive, Trash, and label actions.","mcp__codex_apps__google_drive":"Search and work with files from Google Drive, Docs, Sheets, and Slides.","mcp__codex_apps__higgsfield":"Every image and video model","mcp__codex_apps__hotline":"Look up local helpline information for the user based on country inferred from the conversation. You must use this tool before providing a suicide or self-harm helpline; do not use web search or guess.","mcp__codex_apps__pets":"Create and manage the user's animated companion pets inside ChatGPT Work mode. Use only for ChatGPT Pets, not real-world animal advice, generic pet images, or pets in other apps.","mcp__codex_apps__plugin_management":"Manage plugins, settings, permissions, and connections. Prefer available built-in tools or connected plugins when they fit the task. Proactively search for plugins when an external app, account, or service would materially help, even if the user d...","mcp__codex_apps__safety_settings":"For ChatGPT Parental Controls (your child or teen's settings, features, Study Mode, quiet hours, family setup) and Trusted Contact (setup, status, privacy). Read account state first. Before updates, read the child's controls; prepare only can_upda...","mcp__codex_apps__search_service":"Tool for accessing the internet.","mcp__codex_apps__shazam":"Identify commercially recorded music playing in the user’s environment and then search, inspect, and contextualize that music using Apple Music catalog data (songs, albums, artists, playlists, charts). Also supports retrieving influence relationsh...","mcp__codex_apps__sites":"Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. Use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging. Use this connector for site...","mcp__codex_apps__supabase":"Manage and query databases","mcp__codex_apps__ticketmaster":"Search Ticketmaster For Events","mcp__codex_apps__tripadvisor":"Enables searching for and viewing top-rated hotels on an interactive map, including filtering, sorting (e.g., by value, price, distance, popularity), and optionally obtaining live pricing, reviews, and amenities details for individual properties. ...","mcp__codex_apps__uber_eats":"Use this to search for restaurants, cuisines, and specific dishes available for delivery within the user’s area on Uber Eats. Invoke it whenever the user expresses hunger or interest in food, takeout, restaurants, or delivery, but not for grocery-...","mcp__codex_apps__vercel":"Provides access to documentation search for a specific hosting and deployment platform and tools to manage its projects and deployments, including listing projects, deployments, build logs, and creating temporary authenticated share URLs or fetchi...","mcp__node_repl":"Use `js` for `node_repl` execution with persistent, redeclarable top-level bindings, `js_reset` to clear bindings, and `js_add_node_module_dir` to add package directories."}}}}
